{"author":"Unknown","data":{"content_hash":"a51e9e6115dbe1594126d399e87d45a926c01e335acc9cf9afc46d91f409e68f","digest":{"component_or_area":"MCP tool reference generator and CI drift gate","key_entities":["scripts/gen_mcp_reference.py","docs/mcp-reference.md","gen_env_registry.py","src/rebar/mcp_server.py","build_server()","register_read_tools","register_llm_tools","register_write_tools","_mcp_reads.py","_mcp_llm.py","_mcp_writes.py","REBAR_MCP_READONLY","REBAR_MCP_ALLOW_LLM","REBAR_MCP_ALLOW_JIRA_SYNC","MCP_ENV_VARS","list_tools()","reconcile","fsck","sign_review","run_workflow","sign_manifest","tests/unit/test_gen_mcp_reference.py","tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py",".github/workflows/test.yml",".github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml","rebar-mcp --help"],"problem_keywords":["documentation generator","drift gate","ci gate","mcp tool reference","gate classification","read-only mode","call-time gating","registration-time gating","hybrid tools","tool enumeration"],"propositions":["Generate docs/mcp-reference.md from the MCP server's own three registrars, listing all 47 tools (23 read, 6 llm, 18 write).","The generator must enumerate each registrar with REBAR_MCP_READONLY=0 so conditionally-registered write tools are included, avoiding a partial reference.","Classify each tool by its registering registrar plus a closed four-entry special-case override table (reconcile, fsck, sign_review, run_workflow).","Emit exactly three labeled gate-tier sections (Read-only, LLM-gated, Write-gated) with the four hybrid tools as inline annotations rather than separate sections.","Add a --check drift mode wired into both test.yml and gerrit-verify.yaml CI workflows, enforced by the CI workflow parity test.","A held-out section-bounded test independently asserts correct placement of the special cases, including sign_review being Write-gated and absent from LLM-gated."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1783837903395844046,"uuid":"10e3a3ed-ed04-459a-a4f4-2747b30ff6d3"}